meta {
  name: 03 - Curva de potencia del dia (SEMS+)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: https://eu-gateway.semsportal.com/web/sems/sems-plant/api/v1/hems/power/statisticsAndPreV2
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  token: {{goodwe_token_header}}
}

body:json {
  {"stationId":"{{goodwe_station_id}}","items":["pSystem","pConsum","pGrid"],"timeScale":1,"timeZone":-1,"startTime":"{{goodwe_fecha}} 00:00:00","endTime":"{{goodwe_fecha}} 23:59:59"}
}

docs {
  Potencia minuto a minuto (kW): pSystem = produccion, pConsum = consumo, pGrid = red (negativo = importa). 1440 puntos; los minutos que aun no han pasado van a null. Sustituye a GetPlantPowerChart.
}
